(7016248, 1063028, 63218, '<td valign="top">This photo (&amp; others like it) has inspired me to add a new detail to my voting routine. I leave it up on the screen, take a break, &amp; when I come back  I can see it fresh, from across the room. Kind of like what would happen if I would walk up to it in a gallery. This gives me an opportunity to admire &amp; appreciate the shapes created by highlights &amp; shadows before I get lost in the details. This photo is gorgeous from across the room--very rich mid-tones--&amp; the details are not bad, either! Hope you had a nice spring break!</td>', 'This photo (& others like it) has inspired me to add a new detail to my voting routine. I leave it up on the screen, take a break, & when I come back  I can see it fresh, from across the room. Kind of like what would happen if I would walk up to it in a gallery. This gives me an opportunity to admire & appreciate the shapes created by highlights & shadows before I get lost in the details. This photo is gorgeous from across the room--very rich mid-tones--& the details are not bad, either! Hope you had a nice spring break!', '2013-04-08 12:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
