(7016691, 1063141, 77683, '<td valign="top">being in the weeds is a little distracting. maybe centering up between the pass line and the edge of the road with the bike racing down the middle of the two?</td>', 'being in the weeds is a little distracting. maybe centering up between the pass line and the edge of the road with the bike racing down the middle of the two?', '2013-04-08 22:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
