(7016709, 1062417, 158576, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful shot, great composition, but I''m not seeing leading lines. The curve of the river''s path ends abruptly without leading anywhere. My attention is drawn right to the mountains and the sky, noticing the river almost as an afterthought.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful shot, great composition, but I''m not seeing leading lines. The curve of the river''s path ends abruptly without leading anywhere. My attention is drawn right to the mountains and the sky, noticing the river almost as an afterthought.', '2013-04-08 23:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7016713, 1062272, 158576, '<td valign="top">It''s a good photo, but not a very good example of leading lines. The lines of the boards don''t lead the eye to anything. The girl''s arm and leg combine to kind of form a leading line, but don''t really work. The eye is automatically drawn to her face without being led there by the arm and leg.</td>', 'It''s a good photo, but not a very good example of leading lines. The lines of the boards don''t lead the eye to anything. The girl''s arm and leg combine to kind of form a leading line, but don''t really work. The eye is automatically drawn to her face without being led there by the arm and leg.', '2013-04-08 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7016722, 1063011, 158576, '<td valign="top">The dutch angle just made this confusing for me.</td>', 'The dutch angle just made this confusing for me.', '2013-04-09 00:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
