(7019245, 1063065, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Vivid colors and lines, crystal clear and clean processing.</td>', 'Very nice. Vivid colors and lines, crystal clear and clean processing.', '2013-04-12 23:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7019253, 1062960, 108069, '<td valign="top">I''m in a contemplative mood for powerful personal reasons at the moment, and this image has me. Perhaps the title makes my brain itch. Perhaps it''s also the border, which screams f you, or consider me longer than you would have. Well I''m sold.</td>', 'I''m in a contemplative mood for powerful personal reasons at the moment, and this image has me. Perhaps the title makes my brain itch. Perhaps it''s also the border, which screams f you, or consider me longer than you would have. Well I''m sold.', '2013-04-13 00:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7019324, 1062978, 157380, '<td valign="top">nice find of the leading lines, slightly more convergance on the kayaker would have helped this image for me</td>', 'nice find of the leading lines, slightly more convergance on the kayaker would have helped this image for me', '2013-04-13 04:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7019325, 1063029, 157380, '<td valign="top">a lovely composed and processed picture of nothing, I''m artfully drawn to appoint and there is nothing there :( robbed</td>', 'a lovely composed and processed picture of nothing, I''m artfully drawn to appoint and there is nothing there :( robbed', '2013-04-13 04:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7019326, 1062915, 157380, '<td valign="top">the background keeps pulling my attention, his heal looks like it might be hairy (which just has to be wrong) otherwise nice concept, awesome pose and dramatic lighting.</td>', 'the background keeps pulling my attention, his heal looks like it might be hairy (which just has to be wrong) otherwise nice concept, awesome pose and dramatic lighting.', '2013-04-13 04:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7019328, 1062706, 157380, '<td valign="top">leading lines in action. The sky is ta bit tame for this moody image and the building is a hotspot for attention but your leading lines and point of focus are well considered and processed appropriately</td>', 'leading lines in action. The sky is ta bit tame for this moody image and the building is a hotspot for attention but your leading lines and point of focus are well considered and processed appropriately', '2013-04-13 04:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7019332, 1062911, 157380, '<td valign="top">a tahj</td>', 'a tahj', '2013-04-13 04:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7019334, 1062725, 157380, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2013-04-13 04:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7019371, 1062587, 29490, '<td valign="top">I start at the bottom of this photo and get lost in the reflections of the clouds.  I look for patterns and find crabs and butterflies and Florida and hand puppets.  Then I slowly follow some of the water streams out to sea.<br/> <br/>Then the I''m drawn farther into the image and wonder what the disturbance is in the flow.  Are those fish?  A log?  A crocodile?  A body?<br/> <br/>Then I follow the water out to sea.  And then up the shore, to the people.  Are they as relaxed as they should be? Is the air still warm, or are they getting the early evening chill?  The gentle surf sounds send the cares away.<br/> <br/>What about the houses?  Is someone looking out a window, calling to someone to come in?  Are they calling to the body?  Are they worried? It''s not a body though.<br/> <br/>Finally the light of the city - is it a bustling city or a quiet small town?  Probably a larger city, given the large structure next to the water.<br/> <br/>The people in the foreground are lucky to be away from the city sounds - surrounded by the serenity of the sea.<br/> <br/>I want to be here.</td>', 'I start at the bottom of this photo and get lost in the reflections of the clouds.  I look for patterns and find crabs and butterflies and Florida and hand puppets.  Then I slowly follow some of the water streams out to sea. Then the I''m drawn farther into the image and wonder what the disturbance is in the flow.  Are those fish?  A log?  A crocodile?  A body? Then I follow the water out to sea.  And then up the shore, to the people.  Are they as relaxed as they should be? Is the air still warm, or are they getting the early evening chill?  The gentle surf sounds send the cares away. What about the houses?  Is someone looking out a window, calling to someone to come in?  Are they calling to the body?  Are they worried? It''s not a body though. Finally the light of the city - is it a bustling city or a quiet small town?  Probably a larger city, given the large structure next to the water. The people in the foreground are lucky to be away from the city sounds - surrounded by the serenity of the sea. I want to be here.', '2013-04-13 08:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7019372, 1063192, 29490, '<td valign="top">I''m impressed by your capture!  Nice!<br/>--<br/>I''m coming back for another look - I really like this photo, it eases my soul to see the skies and the buttes competing for majesty with this small human-made structure standing guard.  It is humbling.</td>', 'I''m impressed by your capture!  Nice!--I''m coming back for another look - I really like this photo, it eases my soul to see the skies and the buttes competing for majesty with this small human-made structure standing guard.  It is humbling.', '2013-04-13 08:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
