(7020376, 1062920, 108069, '<td valign="top">I was stalking this photo to see who this was and if I had a fellow DPCer in Boston. Well I already knew this! Great shot. I''ve been meaning to get out there to try something similar.</td>', 'I was stalking this photo to see who this was and if I had a fellow DPCer in Boston. Well I already knew this! Great shot. I''ve been meaning to get out there to try something similar.', '2013-04-15 01:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7020378, 1062417, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CanonShooter:</b></div><hr/><i> It''s a beautiful shot, great composition, but I''m not seeing leading lines. The curve of the river''s path ends abruptly without leading anywhere. My attention is drawn right to the mountains and the sky, noticing the river almost as an afterthought. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I respectfully disagree with your assertion there are no leading lines.</td>', 'Originally posted by CanonShooter: It''s a beautiful shot, great composition, but I''m not seeing leading lines. The curve of the river''s path ends abruptly without leading anywhere. My attention is drawn right to the mountains and the sky, noticing the river almost as an afterthought.  I respectfully disagree with your assertion there are no leading lines.', '2013-04-15 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 0),
