(7020392, 1063169, 69008, '<td valign="top">I found it odd that we both shot photos for two solid days and didn''t really shoot anything with solid leading lines in it.  I guess we were just too distracted to think about shooting for the challenge at the time. <br/>This is a pretty good one though. I like what <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=74588" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">cutout</a> said.</td>', 'I found it odd that we both shot photos for two solid days and didn''t really shoot anything with solid leading lines in it.  I guess we were just too distracted to think about shooting for the challenge at the time. This is a pretty good one though. I like what  cutout said.', '2013-04-15 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
