(7020441, 1062707, 113591, '<td valign="top">The processing gives the scene an edhy feeling. Gritty. so if that was your aim. well done. I think that the image can be used in two ways, one gritty, and the other more soft and protective, if you melt the branches together a bit. Good image either way.</td>', 'The processing gives the scene an edhy feeling. Gritty. so if that was your aim. well done. I think that the image can be used in two ways, one gritty, and the other more soft and protective, if you melt the branches together a bit. Good image either way.', '2013-04-15 02:23:15.000000', NULL, 0),
