(7021128, 1062981, 138630, '<td valign="top">I liked this a lot, Garry.  Gave it a 6 and considered going higher several times.  Loved the tones and light, but in the end decided it was just a tiny bit too bright for me.  I thought the lines, though subtle, were fine and the scene inviting.  And good for you for entering "for the team" - turned out just fine, I think.</td>', 'I liked this a lot, Garry.  Gave it a 6 and considered going higher several times.  Loved the tones and light, but in the end decided it was just a tiny bit too bright for me.  I thought the lines, though subtle, were fine and the scene inviting.  And good for you for entering "for the team" - turned out just fine, I think.', '2013-04-15 22:53:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7021130, 1062981, 124982, '<td valign="top">Thanks Nikki! It''s one of those rare images that I normally don''t "do", but something appealed to me enough to submit it. Occasionally an image will touch me in a way that overcomes my desire for a high-score. This was one of them. Ended up doing much better than expected!</td>', 'Thanks Nikki! It''s one of those rare images that I normally don''t "do", but something appealed to me enough to submit it. Occasionally an image will touch me in a way that overcomes my desire for a high-score. This was one of them. Ended up doing much better than expected!', '2013-04-15 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 0),
