(7021695, 1062907, 103142, '<td valign="top">Sigh* Take a week and a half off, and through in some trip photos, and then Oliver races ahead! How the heck am I supposed to catch up when you''re 12 points ahead, and I have a 5.5 going in bike??<br/> <br/>When I only manage to whittle away a point here or a point there, this is going to take me the rest of the year. :(<br/> <br/>Stop it!<br/> <br/>Seriously -- with that problem with light, this should have scored at least .0000002 lower! ;P<br/> <br/>Congrats on the yellow. :)</td>', 'Sigh* Take a week and a half off, and through in some trip photos, and then Oliver races ahead! How the heck am I supposed to catch up when you''re 12 points ahead, and I have a 5.5 going in bike?? When I only manage to whittle away a point here or a point there, this is going to take me the rest of the year. :( Stop it! Seriously -- with that problem with light, this should have scored at least .0000002 lower! ;P Congrats on the yellow. :)', '2013-04-16 22:40:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7021905, 1062953, 68504, '<td valign="top">ah, so much in one image.</td>', 'ah, so much in one image.', '2013-04-17 03:46:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7022271, 1062852, 28276, '<td valign="top">I love the color and the play of the reflected light off one building onto the other...  <br/> <br/>On it''s own, I actually like the framing of this as well, but in this particular challenge, I''m guessing you lost a few folks who didn''t think the lines were "leading" to a subject.  Another crop with more accent on the sky above (placing the point where the tops of the two buildings are closest) in the lower third might have led the viewers to see the dreamy clouds as the "subject" your lines "led" them to...<br/> <br/>Great job, though.</td>', 'I love the color and the play of the reflected light off one building onto the other...   On it''s own, I actually like the framing of this as well, but in this particular challenge, I''m guessing you lost a few folks who didn''t think the lines were "leading" to a subject.  Another crop with more accent on the sky above (placing the point where the tops of the two buildings are closest) in the lower third might have led the viewers to see the dreamy clouds as the "subject" your lines "led" them to... Great job, though.', '2013-04-17 14:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7022484, 1062682, 30490, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful!  I love the appenglow and the pilings are perfect for this challenge.<br/></td>', 'Wow! Beautiful!  I love the appenglow and the pilings are perfect for this challenge.', '2013-04-17 20:47:29.000000', NULL, 0),
