(7022521, 1062733, 122678, '<td valign="top">Thank you, it pushes me to get better and better.</td>', 'Thank you, it pushes me to get better and better.', '2013-04-17 22:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(7022609, 1062852, 63218, '<td valign="top">The leading lines lead to the sky &amp; I don''t see the sky as ''nothing,'' so I don''t have a problem there. I like the primary colors, which flatten the detail, turning the skyscrapers into cartoon facades. I''m going to guess that the 5-and-below scores were for the primary colors, if for no other reason than that they are not literally realistic.</td>', 'The leading lines lead to the sky & I don''t see the sky as ''nothing,'' so I don''t have a problem there. I like the primary colors, which flatten the detail, turning the skyscrapers into cartoon facades. I''m going to guess that the 5-and-below scores were for the primary colors, if for no other reason than that they are not literally realistic.', '2013-04-18 01:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
